  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Road building/upgrading by the United Nations Office for Project Services (UNOPS) in South Kivu in the Democratic Republic of Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Road building/upgrading by the United Nations Office for Project Services (UNOPS) in South Kivu in the Democratic Republic of Congo is a component of Roads in the East in the Democratic Republic of Congo Phase II reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;9,295,909. It works in the following sector(s): Road transport, Environmental policy and administrative management.</narrative>
